  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARGENTINA SALTA LANDFILL GAS CAPTURE PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to help mitigate climate change through the effective reduction of 79,664 tC02e caused by the methane (GHG) generated in the municipal landfill of Salta, through recovery and flaring of the methane collected at the landfill.</narrative>
  </description>
